key=${validkey}&xwikiname=${xwikiname}")}	#set ($wikiname = $request.serverName)\n#set ($host = ${request.getRequestURL()})\n#set ($host = ${host.substring(0, ${host.indexOf('/', ${mathtool.add(${host.indexOf('//')}, 2)})})})\nSubject: Your account on ${wikiname} has been activated\n\nHello ${xwiki.getUserName("$xwikiname", false)},\n\nYour account on ${wikiname} has been successfully activated. You can now login at ${host}${xwiki.getURL('XWiki.XWikiLogin', 'login')} using your username (${xwiki.getDocument($xwikiname).getName()}).			Panels.QuickLinks,Panels.MyRecentModifications	0	0		---	---	---	---	---	---	PhenoTips.Translations
