-4813332152258561868	1	1	2017-05-12 15:43:30	Install extension [org.xwiki.platform:xwiki-platform-index-ui-7.1.2]	XWiki.Admin	f	<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>\n<xwikidoc>\n<web>XWiki</web>\n<name>DocumentTreeTranslations</name>\n<language>lv</language>\n<defaultLanguage>en</defaultLanguage>\n<translation>1</translation>\n<parent>XWiki.DocumentTree</parent>\n<creator>XWiki.Admin</creator>\n<author>XWiki.Admin</author>\n<customClass></customClass>\n<contentAuthor>XWiki.Admin</contentAuthor>\n<creationDate>1424709160000</creationDate>\n<date>1494618210000</date>\n<contentUpdateDate>1494618210000</contentUpdateDate>\n<version>1.1</version>\n<title>Document Tree Translations</title>\n<defaultTemplate></defaultTemplate>\n<validationScript></validationScript>\n<comment>Install extension [org.xwiki.platform:xwiki-platform-index-ui-7.1.2]</comment>\n<minorEdit>false</minorEdit>\n<syntaxId>xwiki/2.1</syntaxId>\n<hidden>true</hidden>\n<content>## XWiki Translation for language lv generated from http://www.l10n.xwiki.org\nrendering.macro.documentTree.description=Parāda XWiki dokumentu koku\nrendering.macro.documentTree.name=Dokumentu koks\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.checkboxes.description=Vai parādīt katra koka elementa priekšā iezīmējamo rūtiņu, ar kuru var atzīmēt uzreiz vairākus dokumentus kokā.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.checkboxes.name=Iezīmes rūtiņas\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.compact.description=Ja jums ir ierobežots horizontālais laukums, vēlams ieslēgt šo iestatījumu. Rezultātā netiks rādītas dokumentu ikonas un tos saistošās līnijas. Tiks veikti arī citi izskata pielāgojumi, lai nodrošinātu, ka koks aizņem pēc iespējas mazāku horizontālo telpu.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.compact.name=Kompakti\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.filterByClass.description=Rādīt tikai dokumentus, kuriem ir atbilstošs veids. Piemēram, norādot 'Blog.CategoryClass' tiks parādītas tikai emuāru kategorijas. Atstājiet šo lauku tukšu, ja vēlaties, lai kokā ir parādīti visi dokumentu viedi.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.filterByClass.name=Atlasīt pēc klases\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.finder.description=Rādīt teksta lauku, ar kuru var atlasīt parādītos koka elementus. Lauks tiek parādīts virs koka un tajā piedāvā automātisku priekšāteikšanu. Izvēloties noteiktu vērtību, kokā tiek parādīts tikai izvēlētā elementa zars.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.finder.name=Meklētājs\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.links.description=Norāda, vai elementu nosaukumi kokā tiek parādīti un darbojas kā hipersaites.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.links.name=Saites\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.openTo.description=Koka sākuma elements. Tiks parādīts viss koks, kas sākas ar norādīto dokumentu. Elementa identifikatoru norāda kā parametru koka sākumam.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.openTo.name=Atvērt no\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.readOnly.description=Vai lietotājam ir iespējams mainīt koka struktūru, ja viņam ir attiecīgas pieejas tiesības?\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.readOnly.name=Tikai lasāms\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.root.description=Koka sākuma elementa identifikators. Tas noder, ja vēlaties apskatīt koku, tikai sākot ar norādīto elementu (kas tad kalpo kā kokam norādītā sakne). Kokā tiek parādīti elementi, sākot ar saknes bērniem, līdz ar to pats norādītais elements parādīts netiek. Elementa attēlošanas formāts ir\\: Veids\\:Norāde, kur kur vieds var būt viki, vieta vai dokuments. Piem., viki\\:xwiki, vieta\\:xwiki\\:Main, dokuments\\:xwiki\\:Main.WebHome.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.root.name=Sakne\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showAttachments.description=Vai rādīt dokumentu pielikumus\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showAttachments.name=Rādīt pielikumus\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showChildDocuments.description=Vai rādīt bērnu dokumentus, vadoties no norādītā vecāku dokumenta.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showChildDocuments.name=Rādīt bērnu dokumentus\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showClassProperties.description=Vai rādīt klases īpašības dokumentiem, kuros ir definētas klases.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showClassProperties.name=Rādīt klases īpašības\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showDocumentTitle.description=Vai koka mezglam dokumenta nosaukuma vietā rādīt dokumenta virsrakstu. \nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showDocumentTitle.name=Rādīt dokumenta virsrakstu\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showObjects.description=Vai rādīt doumenta objektus\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showObjects.name=Rādīt objektus\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showOnlyViewable.description=Rādīt tikai viki, vietas un dokumentus, kuriem esošajam lietotājam ir pieejas tiesības. Ja ir atslēgts, tad viki, vietas un dokumenti, kas lietotājam nav pieejami tiek parādīti kā dokumentu nosaukumi. Lietotājam nebūs iespēju apskatīt dokumentu saturu, klikšķinot uz šo dokumentu saitēm (tomēr lietotājam būs zināms, ka šādi dokumenti pastāv).\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showOnlyViewable.name=Rādīt tikai redzamos\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showSpaces.description=Vai rādīt vietu mezglus. Ja rāda, tad dokumenti ir grupēti vietu mezglos saskaņā ar to, kādā vietā tie atrodas.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showSpaces.name=Rādīt vietas\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showTranslations.description=Vai rādīt dokumentu tulkojumus\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showTranslations.name=Rādīt tulkojumus\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showWikiPrettyName.description=Attēlojot viki mezglu, rādīt viki skaisto nosaukumu viki identifikatora vietā.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showWikiPrettyName.name=Rādīt viki skaisto nosaukumu\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showWikis.description=Vai rādīt dokumentu kokā kā mezglus viki. To var rādīt tikai galvenajā viki un, ja koka lapu ir saglabājis lietotājs ar programmēšanas tiesībām.\nrendering.macro.documentTree.parameter.showWikis.name=Rādīt viki\n</content></xwikidoc>
-5480613752624810949	1	1	2017-05-12 15:43:30	Install extension [org.xwiki.platform:xwiki-platform-index-ui-7.1.2]	XWiki.Admin	f	<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>\n<xwikidoc>\n<web>XWiki</web>\n<name>AllAttachmentsResults</name>\n<language></language>\n<defaultLanguage></defaultLanguage>\n<translation>0</translation>\n<parent>XWiki.AllAttachments</parent>\n<creator>XWiki.Admin</creator>\n<author>XWiki.Admin</author>\n<customClass></customClass>\n<contentAuthor>XWiki.Admin</contentAuthor>\n<creationDate>1252454400000</creationDate>\n<date>1494618210000</date>\n<contentUpdateDate>1494618210000</contentUpdateDate>\n<version>1.1</version>\n<title>$services.localization.render('platform.index.attachmentsResults')</title>\n<defaultTemplate></defaultTemplate>\n<validationScript></validationScript>\n<comment>Install extension [org.xwiki.platform:xwiki-platform-index-ui-7.1.2]</comment>\n<minorEdit>false</minorEdit>\n<syntaxId>xwiki/2.0</syntaxId>\n<hidden>true</hidden>\n<object>\n<name>XWiki.AllAttachmentsResults</name>\n<number>0</number>\n<className>XWiki.RequiredRightClass</className>\n<guid>bf8888e5-2c90-47ab-9a47-dec1db8bdd54</guid>\n<property>\n<level>programming</level>\n</property>\n</object>\n<content>{{velocity wiki="false"}}\n## ============================================================================================\n## This page is called from live grids via Ajax with the argument xpage=plain. It returns a\n## set of results serialized in JSON.\n## ============================================================================================\n#if ("$!request.get('xpage')" == 'plain')\n  $response.setContentType('application/json')##\n  #set ($offset = $mathtool.toInteger($request.get('offset')))\n  ## offset starts from 0 in velocity and 1 in javascript\n  #set ($offset = $offset - 1)\n  #if (!$offset || $offset &lt; 0)\n    #set ($offset = 0)\n  #end\n  #set ($limit = $mathtool.toInteger($request.get('limit')))\n  #if (!$limit)\n    #set ($limit = 15)\n  #end\n  #set ($title = $request.get('doc.name'))\n  #set ($author = $request.get('author'))\n  #set ($space = $request.get('doc.space'))\n  #set ($filename = $request.filename)\n  #set ($formatDate = 'yyyy MMMM dd, HH:mm')\n  #set ($query = '')\n  #set ($queryParameters = [])\n  #if ($title)\n    #set ($title = $title.trim().toLowerCase())\n    #set ($query = $query + " and lower(doc.name) like ?")\n    #set ($discard = $queryParameters.add("%${title}%"))\n  #end\n  #if ($author)\n    #set ($author = $author.trim().toLowerCase())\n    #set ($query = $query + " and lower(attach.author) like ?")\n    #set ($discard = $queryParameters.add("%${author}%"))\n  #end\n  #if ($filename)\n    #set ($filename = $filename.trim().toLowerCase())\n    #set ($query = $query + " and lower(attach.filename) like ?")\n    #set ($discard = $queryParameters.add("%${filename}%"))\n  #end\n  #if ($space)\n    #set ($space = $space.trim().toLowerCase())\n    #set ($query = $query + " and lower(doc.space) like ?")\n    #set ($discard = $queryParameters.add("%${space}%"))\n  #end\n  ##\n  ## Exclude Blacklisted spaces ($blacklistedSpaces is set in xwikivars.vm)\n  ##\n  #if (!$hasAdmin)\n    #foreach ($blacklistedSpace in $blacklistedSpaces)\n      #set ($query = "${query} and doc.space &lt;&gt; ?")\n      #set ($discard = $queryParameters.add($blacklistedSpace))\n    #end\n  #end\n  #set ($validSortOptions = ['filename', 'doc.name', 'doc.space', 'date', 'author'])\n  #if ($validSortOptions.contains($request.sort))\n    #set ($order = $request.sort)\n  #else\n    #set ($order = 'filename')\n  #end\n  #if (!$order.startsWith('doc.'))\n    #set ($order = "attach.${order}")\n  #end\n  #if ("$!request.dir" == 'desc')\n    #set ($dir = 'desc')\n  #else\n    #set ($dir = 'asc')\n  #end\n  ##\n  ## Compute the final query\n  ##\n  #if ($query == "")\n    #set ($query = "1=1")\n  #end\n  #set ($sortedQuery = $query + " order by $order $dir")\n  #set ($items = $xwiki.searchAttachments($sortedQuery, $limit, $offset, $queryParameters))\n  #set ($totalItems = $xwiki.countAttachments($query, $queryParameters))\n  #set ($returnedItems = $items.size())\n  ## ==============================================\n  ## json starts\n  ## ==============================================\n{\n"totalrows": $totalItems,\n"returnedrows": #if($returnedItems &lt; $limit) $returnedItems #else $limit #end,\n"offset": $mathtool.add($offset, 1),\n"reqNo": $mathtool.toInteger($request.reqNo),\n"rows": [\n#foreach ($attach in $items)\n  #set ($document = $attach.getDocument())\n  #set ($hasAccess = $xwiki.hasAccessLevel('view', $xcontext.user, $document.getFullName()))\n  #if ($velocityCount &gt; 1) , #end\n  { "acclev" : $hasAccess,\n  #if ($hasAccess)\n    "page" : "$escapetool.javascript($document.name)",\n    "space" : "$escapetool.javascript($document.space)",\n    "fullname" : "$escapetool.javascript($document.fullName)",\n    "filename" : "$escapetool.javascript($attach.filename)",\n    "fileurl" : "$document.getAttachmentURL($attach.filename)",\n    "url" : "$document.getURL('view')",\n    "spaceurl" : "$xwiki.getURL("${document.space}.WebHome")",\n    "date" : "$xwiki.formatDate($attach.date, $formatDate)",\n    "author" : "$!escapetool.javascript($attach.author)",\n    "authorname" : "$!escapetool.javascript($xwiki.getUserName($attach.author, false))",\n    "authorurl" : "$xwiki.getURL($attach.author)",\n    "type" : "$!escapetool.javascript($attach.getMimeType())"\n  #else\n    "fullname": "$escapetool.javascript($docName)"\n  #end\n  }\n#end\n]}\n## ==============================================\n## json ended\n## ==============================================\n#end\n{{/velocity}}</content></xwikidoc>\n
-8127487877897324017	1	1	2017-05-12 15:43:30	Install extension [org.xwiki.platform:xwiki-platform-index-ui-7.1.2]	XWiki.Admin	f	<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>\n<xwikidoc>\n<web>XWiki</web>\n<name>DeletedAttachments</name>\n<language></language>\n<defaultLanguage></defaultLanguage>\n<translation>0</translation>\n<parent>Main.AllDocs</parent>\n<creator>XWiki.Admin</creator>\n<author>XWiki.Admin</author>\n<customClass></customClass>\n<contentAuthor>XWiki.Admin</contentAuthor>\n<creationDate>1262178920000</creationDate>\n<date>1494618210000</date>\n<contentUpdateDate>1494618210000</contentUpdateDate>\n<version>1.1</version>\n<title>$services.localization.render('platform.index.attachmentsTrash')</title>\n<defaultTemplate></defaultTemplate>\n<validationScript></validationScript>\n<comment>Install extension [org.xwiki.platform:xwiki-platform-index-ui-7.1.2]</comment>\n<minorEdit>false</minorEdit>\n<syntaxId>xwiki/2.0</syntaxId>\n<hidden>true</hidden>\n<object>\n<class>\n<name>XWiki.JavaScriptExtension</name>\n<customClass></customClass>\n<customMapping></customMapping>\n<defaultViewSheet></defaultViewSheet>\n<defaultEditSheet></defaultEditSheet>\n<defaultWeb></defaultWeb>\n<nameField></nameField>\n<validationScript></validationScript>\n<cache>\n<cache>0</cache>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayType>select</displayType>\n<multiSelect>0</multiSelect>\n<name>cache</name>\n<number>5</number>\n<prettyName>Caching policy</prettyName>\n<relationalStorage>0</relationalStorage>\n<separator> </separator>\n<separators>|, </separators>\n<size>1</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<values>long|short|default|forbid</values>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.StaticListClass</classType>\n</cache>\n<code>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<name>code</name>\n<number>2</number>\n<prettyName>Code</prettyName>\n<rows>20</rows>\n<size>50</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.TextAreaClass</classType>\n</code>\n<name>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<name>name</name>\n<number>1</number>\n<prettyName>Name</prettyName>\n<size>30</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.StringClass</classType>\n</name>\n<parse>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayFormType>select</displayFormType>\n<displayType>yesno</displayType>\n<name>parse</name>\n<number>4</number>\n<prettyName>Parse content</prettyName>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.BooleanClass</classType>\n</parse>\n<use>\n<cache>0</cache>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayType>select</displayType>\n<multiSelect>0</multiSelect>\n<name>use</name>\n<number>3</number>\n<prettyName>Use this extension</prettyName>\n<relationalStorage>0</relationalStorage>\n<separator> </separator>\n<separators>|, </separators>\n<size>1</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<values>currentPage|onDemand|always</values>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.StaticListClass</classType>\n</use>\n</class>\n<name>XWiki.DeletedAttachments</name>\n<number>0</number>\n<className>XWiki.JavaScriptExtension</className>\n<guid>2b1a4426-e37b-40ba-9ad3-4055a466da0a</guid>\n<property>\n<cache>long</cache>\n</property>\n<property>\n<code>// Make sure the XWiki.index.trash.attachments 'namespace' exists.\nif (typeof XWiki == "undefined") {\n  XWiki = new Object();\n}\nif (typeof XWiki.index == "undefined") {\n  XWiki.index = new Object();\n}\nif (typeof XWiki.index.trash == "undefined") {\n  XWiki.index.trash = new Object();\n}\nif (typeof XWiki.index.trash.attachments == "undefined") {\n  XWiki.index.trash.attachments = new Object();\n}\n\n/**\n * Callback function used by the DeletedAttachments livetable for generating the HTML code needed to display an entry.\n * \n * @param row the JSON data corresponding to the entry to be displayed\n * @param i the index of the row in the list of entries\n * @param table the LiveTable javascript object\n */\nXWiki.index.trash.attachments.displayEntry = function (row, i, table) {\n  var tr = new Element('tr'); // The resulting table row\n  var file = new Element('a', {'href' : row.url}).update(row.filename);\n  tr.appendChild(new Element('td').update(file));\n  var doc = new Element('a', {'href' : row.documentUrl}).update(row.title);\n  doc.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' (' + row.docName + ')'));\n  tr.appendChild(new Element('td').update(doc));\n  tr.appendChild(new Element('td').update(row.date));\n  var deleter = new Element('a', {'href' : row.deleterurl}).update(row.deletername);\n  tr.appendChild(new Element('td').update(deleter));\n  var actions = new Element('td', {'class' : 'itemActions'});\n  if(row.canDelete) {\n    var delete_ = new Element('a', {\n        'href' : row.deleteUrl,\n        'class' : "tool delete",\n        'title' : "$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachmentsActionsDeleteTooltip')"\n      }).update("$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachmentsActionsDeleteText')");\n    actions.appendChild(delete_);\n    delete_.observe('click', XWiki.index.trash.attachments.confirmDelete.bindAsEventListener(delete_, table, i));\n  }\n  tr.appendChild(actions);\n  return tr;\n}\n\n/**\n * Event listener, called when clicking a delete version link. It displays a confirmation box, speeding up the two-step\n * deletion process.\n * \n * @param event the link activation event\n * @param table the LiveTable javascript object\n * @param rowIdx the index of the row corresponding to the entry to be deleted\n */\nXWiki.index.trash.attachments.confirmDelete = function(event, table, rowIdx) {\n  event.stop();\n  if (this.disabled) {\n    // Do nothing if the button was already clicked and it's waiting for a response from the server.\n    return;\n  } else {\n    new XWiki.widgets.ConfirmedAjaxRequest(\n      /* Ajax request URL */\n      this.href + '&amp;confirm=1' + (Prototype.Browser.Opera ? "" : "&amp;ajax=1"),\n      /* Ajax request parameters */\n      {\n        onCreate : function() {\n          // Disable the button, to avoid a cascade of clicks from impatient users\n          this.disabled = true;\n        }.bind(this),\n        onSuccess : function(table, rowIdx) {\n          // Remove the corresponding HTML element from the UI and update the livetable\n          table.deleteRow(rowIdx);\n        }.bind(this, table, rowIdx),\n        // This is an expected 404, returned when the document has been successfully deleted and is no longer found\n        on404 : function(response, table, rowIdx) {\n          response.request.options.onSuccess(table, rowIdx);\n        }.bindAsEventListener(this, table, rowIdx),\n        onComplete : function() {\n          // In the end: re-enable the button\n          this.disabled = false;\n        }.bind(this)\n      },\n      /* Interaction parameters */\n      {\n         confirmationText: "$services.localization.render('core.recyclebin.completelyDeleteConfirm')",\n         progressMessageText : "$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachmentsDeleteInProgress')",\n         successMessageText : "$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachmentsDeleteDone')",\n         failureMessageText : "$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachmentsDeleteFailed')"\n      }\n      );\n  }\n}\n/*\n * The livetable is hidden when javascript is disabled, so that an alternative &lt;noscript&gt; table is displayed.\n * Re-display it when the document loads and Javascript is available.\n */\ndocument.observe('xwiki:dom:loaded', function() {\n  if ($('attachmentTrash')) {\n    $('attachmentTrash').up('.hidden').removeClassName('hidden');\n  }\n});</code>\n</property>\n<property>\n<name></name>\n</property>\n<property>\n<parse>1</parse>\n</property>\n<property>\n<use>onDemand</use>\n</property>\n</object>\n<object>\n<name>XWiki.DeletedAttachments</name>\n<number>0</number>\n<className>XWiki.RequiredRightClass</className>\n<guid>b70cdd38-4b2d-4dea-b1e0-c054359d3793</guid>\n<property>\n<level>programming</level>\n</property>\n</object>\n<object>\n<class>\n<name>XWiki.StyleSheetExtension</name>\n<customClass></customClass>\n<customMapping></customMapping>\n<defaultViewSheet></defaultViewSheet>\n<defaultEditSheet></defaultEditSheet>\n<defaultWeb></defaultWeb>\n<nameField></nameField>\n<validationScript></validationScript>\n<cache>\n<cache>0</cache>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayType>select</displayType>\n<multiSelect>0</multiSelect>\n<name>cache</name>\n<number>5</number>\n<prettyName>Caching policy</prettyName>\n<relationalStorage>0</relationalStorage>\n<separator> </separator>\n<separators>|, </separators>\n<size>1</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<values>long|short|default|forbid</values>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.StaticListClass</classType>\n</cache>\n<code>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<name>code</name>\n<number>2</number>\n<prettyName>Code</prettyName>\n<rows>20</rows>\n<size>50</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.TextAreaClass</classType>\n</code>\n<contentType>\n<cache>0</cache>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayType>select</displayType>\n<multiSelect>0</multiSelect>\n<name>contentType</name>\n<number>6</number>\n<prettyName>Content Type</prettyName>\n<relationalStorage>0</relationalStorage>\n<separator> </separator>\n<separators>|, </separators>\n<size>1</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<values>CSS|LESS</values>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.StaticListClass</classType>\n</contentType>\n<name>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<name>name</name>\n<number>1</number>\n<prettyName>Name</prettyName>\n<size>30</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.StringClass</classType>\n</name>\n<parse>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayFormType>select</displayFormType>\n<displayType>yesno</displayType>\n<name>parse</name>\n<number>4</number>\n<prettyName>Parse content</prettyName>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.BooleanClass</classType>\n</parse>\n<use>\n<cache>0</cache>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayType>select</displayType>\n<multiSelect>0</multiSelect>\n<name>use</name>\n<number>3</number>\n<prettyName>Use this extension</prettyName>\n<relationalStorage>0</relationalStorage>\n<separator> </separator>\n<separators>|, </separators>\n<size>1</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<values>currentPage|onDemand|always</values>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.StaticListClass</classType>\n</use>\n</class>\n<name>XWiki.DeletedAttachments</name>\n<number>0</number>\n<className>XWiki.StyleSheetExtension</className>\n<guid>33778e4e-5d86-472e-b065-c9c87b5b282e</guid>\n<property>\n<cache>long</cache>\n</property>\n<property>\n<code>.itemActions .tool {\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n  margin: 0 2px;\n  float: left;\n  text-indent: -1000em;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: transparent no-repeat center center;\n}\n.itemActions .delete {\n  background-image: url("$xwiki.getSkinFile('icons/silk/cross.png')") !important;\n}\n.itemActions .restore {\n   background-image: url("$xwiki.getSkinFile('icons/silk/arrow_refresh.png')") !important;\n}\n.itemActions .cannot-restore {\n   background-image: url("$xwiki.getSkinFile('icons/silk/page_error.png')") !important;\n}</code>\n</property>\n<property>\n<name></name>\n</property>\n<property>\n<parse>1</parse>\n</property>\n<property>\n<use>onDemand</use>\n</property>\n</object>\n<object>\n<class>\n<name>XWiki.XWikiRights</name>\n<customClass></customClass>\n<customMapping></customMapping>\n<defaultViewSheet></defaultViewSheet>\n<defaultEditSheet></defaultEditSheet>\n<defaultWeb></defaultWeb>\n<nameField></nameField>\n<validationScript></validationScript>\n<allow>\n<defaultValue>1</defaultValue>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayFormType>select</displayFormType>\n<displayType>allow</displayType>\n<name>allow</name>\n<number>4</number>\n<prettyName>Allow/Deny</prettyName>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.BooleanClass</classType>\n</allow>\n<groups>\n<cache>0</cache>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayType>input</displayType>\n<multiSelect>1</multiSelect>\n<name>groups</name>\n<number>1</number>\n<picker>1</picker>\n<prettyName>Groups</prettyName>\n<relationalStorage>0</relationalStorage>\n<separator> </separator>\n<size>5</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.GroupsClass</classType>\n</groups>\n<levels>\n<cache>0</cache>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayType>select</displayType>\n<multiSelect>1</multiSelect>\n<name>levels</name>\n<number>2</number>\n<prettyName>Levels</prettyName>\n<relationalStorage>0</relationalStorage>\n<separator> </separator>\n<size>3</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.LevelsClass</classType>\n</levels>\n<users>\n<cache>0</cache>\n<disabled>0</disabled>\n<displayType>input</displayType>\n<multiSelect>1</multiSelect>\n<name>users</name>\n<number>3</number>\n<picker>1</picker>\n<prettyName>Users</prettyName>\n<relationalStorage>0</relationalStorage>\n<separator> </separator>\n<size>5</size>\n<unmodifiable>0</unmodifiable>\n<classType>com.xpn.xwiki.objects.classes.UsersClass</classType>\n</users>\n</class>\n<name>XWiki.DeletedAttachments</name>\n<number>0</number>\n<className>XWiki.XWikiRights</className>\n<guid>8d68ba7a-72d3-4f9f-a984-c7c47139b0a8</guid>\n<property>\n<allow>1</allow>\n</property>\n<property>\n<groups>XWiki.XWikiAdminGroup</groups>\n</property>\n<property>\n<levels>view,edit</levels>\n</property>\n<property>\n<users></users>\n</property>\n</object>\n<content>{{velocity}}\n#if(!$xwiki.hasProgrammingRights())\n  {{warning}}This document requires programming rights and needs to be saved by an administrator of this Wiki{{/warning}}\n#else\n#set($dateFormat = 'yyyy MMMM d, HH:mm')\n#if(!$request.list)\n$xwiki.ssx.use('XWiki.DeletedAttachments')##\n$xwiki.jsx.use('XWiki.DeletedAttachments', {'minify' : 'false'})##\n##\n#set($columns = ['datt.filename', 'datt.docName', 'datt.date', 'datt.deleter', 'actions'])\n#set($columnProperties = {\n    'datt.filename'  : { 'type' : 'text', 'size' : 10 },\n    'datt.docName'   : { 'type' : 'text', 'size' : 10 },\n    'datt.date'      : { 'type' : 'date', 'filterable' : false },\n    'datt.deleter'   : { 'type' : 'text', 'size' : 10 },\n    'actions'        : { 'type' : 'text', 'filterable' : false, 'sortable' : false }\n  })##\n#set($options = {\n    'url'               : "$xwiki.getURL('XWiki.DeletedAttachments', 'view', 'list=1&amp;xpage=plain&amp;outputSyntax=plain')",\n    'callback'          : 'XWiki.index.trash.attachments.displayEntry',\n    'translationPrefix' : 'platform.index.trashAttachments.'\n  })##\n##\n##\n##\n{{html wiki="true" clean="false"}}\n&lt;div class="hidden"&gt;\n#livetable('attachmentTrash' $columns $columnProperties $options)\n&lt;/div&gt;\n{{/html}}\n\n{{html wiki="true" clean="false"}}\n&lt;noscript&gt;\n\n  #set($deletedAttachments = $services.query.hql('select count(datt.id) from DeletedAttachment as datt').execute().get(0))\n  #if($deletedAttachments == 0)\n\n    {{info}}$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachmentsEmpty'){{/info}}\n\n  #else\n  #macro(displayDeletedAttachment $id)\n    #set($datt = $xwiki.getDeletedAttachment("$id"))\n    #set($originalAttachment = $datt.getAttachment())\n    #set($originalDocument = $xwiki.getDocument($datt.docName))\n    &lt;tr&gt;\n      &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="$originalDocument.getAttachmentRevisionURL($originalAttachment.filename, $originalAttachment.version, "rid=${datt.id}").replaceAll('&amp;', '&amp;amp;')"&gt;$escapetool.xml($datt.filename)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n      &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="$originalDocument.getURL()"&gt;$escapetool.xml($originalDocument.plainTitle) ($escapetool.xml(${originalDocument.fullName}))&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n      &lt;td&gt;$xwiki.formatDate($datt.getDate(), $dateFormat)&lt;/td&gt;\n      &lt;td&gt;$xwiki.getUserName($datt.getDeleter())&lt;/td&gt;\n      &lt;td class="itemActions"&gt;\n        #if($datt.canDelete())\n          &lt;a href="${originalDocument.getAttachmentURL($datt.filename, 'delattachment', "trashId=${datt.id}&amp;amp;xredirect=$escapetool.url($!request.getRequestURI())?$escapetool.url($!request.getQueryString())")}" class="tool delete" title="$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachmentsActionsDeleteTooltip')"&gt;$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachmentsDeleteText')&lt;/a&gt;\n        #end\n      &lt;/td&gt;\n    &lt;/tr&gt;\n  #end\n##\n  #if("$!{request.view}" == '')\n    #set($queryParams = '')\n  #else\n    #set($queryParams = "view=$!{escapetool.url($request.view)}")\n  #end\n  #set($paginationParameters = {\n    'totalItems' : $services.query.hql('select count(datt.id) from DeletedAttachment as datt').execute().get(0),\n    'defaultItemsPerPage' : 15,\n    'url' : $doc.getURL('view', $queryParams)\n  })\n  #pagination($paginationParameters)\n  &lt;table id="searchResults" class="xwiki-livetable xwiki-livetable-display"&gt;\n    &lt;thead class="xwiki-livetable-display-header"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;\n      &lt;th scope="col" class="xwiki-livetable-display-header-text selected asc"&gt;$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachments.datt.filename')&lt;/th&gt;\n      &lt;th scope="col" class="xwiki-livetable-display-header-text"&gt;$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachments.datt.docName')&lt;/th&gt;\n      &lt;th scope="col" class="xwiki-livetable-display-header-text"&gt;$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachments.datt.date')&lt;/th&gt;\n      &lt;th scope="col" class="xwiki-livetable-display-header-text"&gt;$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachments.datt.deleter')&lt;/th&gt;\n      &lt;th scope="col" class="xwiki-livetable-display-header-text"&gt;$services.localization.render('platform.index.trashAttachments.actions')&lt;/th&gt;\n    &lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;\n    &lt;tbody class="xwiki-livetable-display-body"&gt;\n    #set ($query = $services.query.hql('select datt.id from DeletedAttachment as datt order by datt.filename asc'))\n    #foreach($item in $query.setLimit($paginationParameters.itemsPerPage).setOffset($paginationParameters.firstItem).execute())\n      #displayDeletedAttachment($item)\n    #end\n    &lt;/tbody&gt;\n  &lt;/table&gt;\n  #set($discard = $paginationParameters.put('position', 'bottom'))\n  #pagination($paginationParameters)\n  #end ## deletedAttachments != 0\n&lt;/noscript&gt;\n{{/html}}##\n#else ## request.list\n## ============================================================================================\n## This page is called from live table via Ajax with the argument xpage=plain. It returns a\n## set of results serialized in JSON.\n## @programming This service page needs to be saved by a user with the programming access level\n## to work as expected\n## ============================================================================================\n#if("$!{request.get('xpage')}" == 'plain')\n$response.setContentType('application/json')\n#set($offset = $mathtool.toInteger($request.get('offset')))\n## offset starts from 0 in velocity and 1 in javascript\n#set($offset = $offset - 1)\n#if (!$offset || $offset &lt; 0)\n  #set ($offset = 0)\n#end\n#set($limit = $mathtool.toInteger($request.get('limit')))\n#if (!$limit)\n  #set ($limit = 15)\n#end\n#set($filenameFilter = $request.get('datt.filename'))\n#set($docNameFilter = $request.get('datt.docName'))\n#set($deleterFilter = $request.get('datt.deleter'))\n#set($sql = '')\n#if("$!{filenameFilter}" != '')\n  #set($sql = "and lower(datt.filename) like '%${filenameFilter.trim().toLowerCase()}%' ")\n#end\n#if("$!{docNameFilter}" != '')\n  #set($sql = "and lower(datt.docName) like '%${docNameFilter.trim().toLowerCase()}%' ")\n#end\n#if("$!{deleterFilter}" != '')\n  #set($sql = $sql + "and lower(datt.deleter) like '%${deleterFilter.trim().toLowerCase()}%' ")\n#end\n#if("$!{request.sort}" != '')\n  #set($order = $request.sort)\n#else\n  #set($order = 'datt.id')\n#end\n#if("$!{request.dir}" != '')\n  #set($dir = $request.dir)\n#else\n  #set($dir = 'asc')\n#end\n#set($selectSql = "select datt.id, $order from DeletedAttachment as datt where 1=1 " + $sql + " order by $order $dir")\n#set($countSql = "select count(*) from DeletedAttachment as datt where 1=1 " + $sql)\n#set($items = $services.query.hql($selectSql).setLimit($limit).setOffset($offset).execute())\n#set($totalItems = $services.query.hql($countSql).execute().get(0))\n#set($returnedItems = $items.size())\n## ==============================================\n## json starts\n## ==============================================\n{\n"totalrows": $totalItems,\n"returnedrows": $returnedItems,\n"offset": ${mathtool.add($offset, 1)},\n"reqNo": ${request.reqNo},\n"query" : "$selectSql", \n"rows": [\n#foreach($item in $items)\n  #set($datt = $xwiki.getDeletedAttachment("$item.get(0)"))\n  #if($velocityCount &gt; 1) , #end\n  {\n    #set($originalAttachment = $datt.getAttachment())\n    #set($originalDocument = $xwiki.getDocument($datt.docName))\n    "filename"  : "$escapetool.javascript($datt.filename)",\n    "docName"  : "$escapetool.javascript($datt.docName)",\n    "title"  : "$escapetool.javascript($originalDocument.plainTitle)",\n    "url" : "$originalDocument.getAttachmentRevisionURL($originalAttachment.filename, $originalAttachment.version, "rid=${datt.id}")",\n    "documentUrl" : "$originalDocument.getURL()",\n    "canDelete" : $datt.canDelete(),\n    "deleteUrl" : "$originalDocument.getAttachmentURL($datt.filename, 'delattachment', "trashId=${datt.id}&amp;form_token=$!{services.csrf.getToken()}")",\n    "canRestore" : $datt.canRestore(),\n    "alreadyExists" : #if($originalDocument.getAttachment($datt.filename)) true #else false #end,\n    "restoreUrl" : "$originalDocument.getAttachmentURL($datt.filename)",\n    "date" : "$xwiki.formatDate($datt.date, $dateFormat)",\n    "deleter" : "$escapetool.javascript($datt.deleter)",\n    "deletername" : "$escapetool.javascript($xwiki.getUserName($datt.deleter, false))",\n    "deleterurl" : "$xwiki.getURL($datt.deleter, 'view')"\n  }\n#end\n]}\n## ==============================================\n## json ended\n## ==============================================\n#end## xpage=plain\n#end## request.list\n#end## hasProgramR\n{{/velocity}}</content></xwikidoc>\n
